@startuml component-backend
!theme plain
skinparam nodesep 16
skinparam ranksep 18
skinparam padding 8
top to bottom direction
title 后端子系统构件图（backend/internal，运行时）

[cli] as cli
[engine] as engine
[walk] as walk
[filter] as filter
[fsmeta] as fsmeta
[pack\nMyPack] as pack
[huffman] as huffman
package "自研 crypto" {
  [sha256] as sha
  [hmac] as hmac
  [pbkdf2] as pbkdf2
  [aes] as aes
}
[container\n.dbk] as container
[repo] as repo
[config] as config
[jsonl] as jsonl
[version] as version

cli -down-> engine : Backup / DryRun / Restore
cli -down-> repo : List / Info / Delete / Resolve
cli -down-> config : Load / Save / Set
cli -right-> jsonl : stdout JSONL
cli -right-> version : ~--version
engine -down-> walk : 先序遍历
engine -down-> filter : Criteria → Decision
engine -down-> pack : Writer / Reader
engine -down-> huffman : 可选压缩
engine -down-> container : .dbk 读写
engine -down-> repo : 仓库落盘
walk -down-> fsmeta : FileInfo / Lstat
walk -right-> filter
pack -down-> fsmeta
filter -down-> fsmeta
container -down-> sha : 未加密：SHA-256(头‖负载‖尾)
container -down-> hmac : 加密：HMAC-SHA256
container -down-> pbkdf2 : 口令 → 密钥
container -down-> aes : AES-256-CBC

note bottom of cli
  依赖方向自上而下。
  pack / huffman / crypto 不依赖 engine / cli。
  testutil 只在测试里使用，不是运行时构件。
end note
@enduml
